{
  "dom_id": "step-36350",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying a Scatter Plot Given a Correlation Coefficient",
  "problem": "It is known that there is a linear correlation between the variables $x$ and $y.$ Given that the correlation coefficient is $\\rho\\approx -0.85,$ sketch a possible scatter plot that corresponds to this situation.",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that the linear correlation coefficient $\\rho$ satisfies the inequality\n\n$$\n-1 \\leq \\rho \\leq 1,\n$$\n\nwhere $\\rho = 1$ indicates a perfect positive correlation, and $\\rho = -1$ indicates a perfect negative correlation.\n\nTherefore, since $\\rho \\approx -0.85,$ there is a *strong negative* linear correlation in the data.\n\n- The *negative* linear correlation means that the data points should be scattered along a line with a *negative* slope.\n\n- Since the correlation is *strong*, most of the points should lie *close* to the trend line.\n\nTherefore, this situation could correspond to the following scatter plot:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14226558/assets/ad8ff5e49649b5e788b83eb28fa26afae61072d5e63026631a9cd1891be14a0c.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-36350\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"36350\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"9698\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-36350\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-9\">Identifying a Scatter Plot Given a Correlation Coefficient</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"36350\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>It is known that there is a linear correlation between the variables <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.33ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 572.5 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">x</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-78\" d=\"M52 289Q59 331 106 386T222 442Q257 442 286 424T329 379Q371 442 430 442Q467 442 494 420T522 361Q522 332 508 314T481 292T458 288Q439 288 427 299T415 328Q415 374 465 391Q454 404 425 404Q412 404 406 402Q368 386 350 336Q290 115 290 78Q290 50 306 38T341 26Q378 26 414 59T463 140Q466 150 469 151T485 153H489Q504 153 504 145Q504 144 502 134Q486 77 440 33T333 -11Q263 -11 227 52Q186 -10 133 -10H127Q78 -10 57 16T35 71Q35 103 54 123T99 143Q142 143 142 101Q142 81 130 66T107 46T94 41L91 40Q91 39 97 36T113 29T132 26Q168 26 194 71Q203 87 217 139T245 247T261 313Q266 340 266 352Q266 380 251 392T217 404Q177 404 142 372T93 290Q91 281 88 280T72 278H58Q52 284 52 289Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.802ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 776 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">y.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-79\" d=\"M21 287Q21 301 36 335T84 406T158 442Q199 442 224 419T250 355Q248 336 247 334Q247 331 231 288T198 191T182 105Q182 62 196 45T238 27Q261 27 281 38T312 61T339 94Q339 95 344 114T358 173T377 247Q415 397 419 404Q432 431 462 431Q475 431 483 424T494 412T496 403Q496 390 447 193T391 -23Q363 -106 294 -155T156 -205Q111 -205 77 -183T43 -117Q43 -95 50 -80T69 -58T89 -48T106 -45Q150 -45 150 -87Q150 -107 138 -122T115 -142T102 -147L99 -148Q101 -153 118 -160T152 -167H160Q177 -167 186 -165Q219 -156 247 -127T290 -65T313 -9T321 21L315 17Q309 13 296 6T270 -6Q250 -11 231 -11Q185 -11 150 11T104 82Q103 89 103 113Q103 170 138 262T173 379Q173 380 173 381Q173 390 173 393T169 400T158 404H154Q131 404 112 385T82 344T65 302T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-79\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"497\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> Given that the correlation coefficient is <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"10.89ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 4688.6 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\rho\\approx -0.85,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-3C1\" d=\"M58 -216Q25 -216 23 -186Q23 -176 73 26T127 234Q143 289 182 341Q252 427 341 441Q343 441 349 441T359 442Q432 442 471 394T510 276Q510 219 486 165T425 74T345 13T266 -10H255H248Q197 -10 165 35L160 41L133 -71Q108 -168 104 -181T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216ZM424 322Q424 359 407 382T357 405Q322 405 287 376T231 300Q217 269 193 170L176 102Q193 26 260 26Q298 26 334 62Q367 92 389 158T418 266T424 322Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2248\" d=\"M55 319Q55 360 72 393T114 444T163 472T205 482Q207 482 213 482T223 483Q262 483 296 468T393 413L443 381Q502 346 553 346Q609 346 649 375T694 454Q694 465 698 474T708 483Q722 483 722 452Q722 386 675 338T555 289Q514 289 468 310T388 357T308 404T224 426Q164 426 125 393T83 318Q81 289 69 289Q55 289 55 319ZM55 85Q55 126 72 159T114 210T163 238T205 248Q207 248 213 248T223 249Q262 249 296 234T393 179L443 147Q502 112 553 112Q609 112 649 141T694 220Q694 249 708 249T722 217Q722 153 675 104T555 55Q514 55 468 76T388 123T308 170T224 192Q164 192 125 159T83 84Q80 55 69 55Q55 55 55 85Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-38\" d=\"M70 417T70 494T124 618T248 666Q319 666 374 624T429 515Q429 485 418 459T392 417T361 389T335 371T324 363L338 354Q352 344 366 334T382 323Q457 264 457 174Q457 95 399 37T249 -22Q159 -22 101 29T43 155Q43 263 172 335L154 348Q133 361 127 368Q70 417 70 494ZM286 386L292 390Q298 394 301 396T311 403T323 413T334 425T345 438T355 454T364 471T369 491T371 513Q371 556 342 586T275 624Q268 625 242 625Q201 625 165 599T128 534Q128 511 141 492T167 463T217 431Q224 426 228 424L286 386ZM250 21Q308 21 350 55T392 137Q392 154 387 169T375 194T353 216T330 234T301 253T274 270Q260 279 244 289T218 306L210 311Q204 311 181 294T133 239T107 157Q107 98 150 60T250 21Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-3C1\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2248\" x=\"795\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1851\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2630,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-38\" x=\"779\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"1279\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4410\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> sketch a possible scatter plot that corresponds to this situation.</p>\n\n            </div>     \n\n            <div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n\n            <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Recall that the linear correlation coefficient <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.202ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 517.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\rho</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-3C1\" d=\"M58 -216Q25 -216 23 -186Q23 -176 73 26T127 234Q143 289 182 341Q252 427 341 441Q343 441 349 441T359 442Q432 442 471 394T510 276Q510 219 486 165T425 74T345 13T266 -10H255H248Q197 -10 165 35L160 41L133 -71Q108 -168 104 -181T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216ZM424 322Q424 359 407 382T357 405Q322 405 287 376T231 300Q217 269 193 170L176 102Q193 26 260 26Q298 26 334 62Q367 92 389 158T418 266T424 322Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-3C1\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> satisfies the inequality\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"12.179ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 5243.6 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n-1 \\leq \\rho \\leq 1,\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2264\" d=\"M674 636Q682 636 688 630T694 615T687 601Q686 600 417 472L151 346L399 228Q687 92 691 87Q694 81 694 76Q694 58 676 56H670L382 192Q92 329 90 331Q83 336 83 348Q84 359 96 365Q104 369 382 500T665 634Q669 636 674 636ZM84 -118Q84 -108 99 -98H678Q694 -104 694 -118Q694 -130 679 -138H98Q84 -131 84 -118Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-3C1\" d=\"M58 -216Q25 -216 23 -186Q23 -176 73 26T127 234Q143 289 182 341Q252 427 341 441Q343 441 349 441T359 442Q432 442 471 394T510 276Q510 219 486 165T425 74T345 13T266 -10H255H248Q197 -10 165 35L160 41L133 -71Q108 -168 104 -181T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216ZM424 322Q424 359 407 382T357 405Q322 405 287 376T231 300Q217 269 193 170L176 102Q193 26 260 26Q298 26 334 62Q367 92 389 158T418 266T424 322Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"778\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2264\" x=\"1556\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-3C1\" x=\"2613\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2264\" x=\"3408\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"4464\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4965\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nwhere <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"5.463ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 2352.1 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\rho = 1</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-3C1\" d=\"M58 -216Q25 -216 23 -186Q23 -176 73 26T127 234Q143 289 182 341Q252 427 341 441Q343 441 349 441T359 442Q432 442 471 394T510 276Q510 219 486 165T425 74T345 13T266 -10H255H248Q197 -10 165 35L160 41L133 -71Q108 -168 104 -181T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216ZM424 322Q424 359 407 382T357 405Q322 405 287 376T231 300Q217 269 193 170L176 102Q193 26 260 26Q298 26 334 62Q367 92 389 158T418 266T424 322Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-3C1\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"795\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"1851\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> indicates a perfect positive correlation, and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"7.271ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 3130.6 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\rho = -1</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-3C1\" d=\"M58 -216Q25 -216 23 -186Q23 -176 73 26T127 234Q143 289 182 341Q252 427 341 441Q343 441 349 441T359 442Q432 442 471 394T510 276Q510 219 486 165T425 74T345 13T266 -10H255H248Q197 -10 165 35L160 41L133 -71Q108 -168 104 -181T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216ZM424 322Q424 359 407 382T357 405Q322 405 287 376T231 300Q217 269 193 170L176 102Q193 26 260 26Q298 26 334 62Q367 92 389 158T418 266T424 322Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMATHI-3C1\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"795\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1851\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"2630\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> indicates a perfect negative correlation.</p>\n<p>Therefore, since <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"10.89ex\" height=\"2.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 4688.6 1152.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\\rho \\approx -0.85,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMATHI-3C1\" d=\"M58 -216Q25 -216 23 -186Q23 -176 73 26T127 234Q143 289 182 341Q252 427 341 441Q343 441 349 441T359 442Q432 442 471 394T510 276Q510 219 486 165T425 74T345 13T266 -10H255H248Q197 -10 165 35L160 41L133 -71Q108 -168 104 -181T92 -202Q76 -216 58 -216ZM424 322Q424 359 407 382T357 405Q322 405 287 376T231 300Q217 269 193 170L176 102Q193 26 260 26Q298 26 334 62Q367 92 389 158T418 266T424 322Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2248\" d=\"M55 319Q55 360 72 393T114 444T163 472T205 482Q207 482 213 482T223 483Q262 483 296 468T393 413L443 381Q502 346 553 346Q609 346 649 375T694 454Q694 465 698 474T708 483Q722 483 722 452Q722 386 675 338T555 289Q514 289 468 310T388 357T308 404T224 426Q164 426 125 393T83 318Q81 289 69 289Q55 289 55 319ZM55 85Q55 126 72 159T114 210T163 238T205 248Q207 248 213 248T223 249Q262 249 296 234T393 179L443 147Q502 112 553 112Q609 112 649 141T694 220Q694 249 708 249T722 217Q722 153 675 104T555 55Q514 55 468 76T388 123T308 170T224 192Q164 192 125 159T83 84Q80 55 69 55Q55 55 55 85Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2212\" d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-38\" d=\"M70 417T70 494T124 618T248 666Q319 666 374 624T429 515Q429 485 418 459T392 417T361 389T335 371T324 363L338 354Q352 344 366 334T382 323Q457 264 457 174Q457 95 399 37T249 -22Q159 -22 101 29T43 155Q43 263 172 335L154 348Q133 361 127 368Q70 417 70 494ZM286 386L292 390Q298 394 301 396T311 403T323 413T334 425T345 438T355 454T364 471T369 491T371 513Q371 556 342 586T275 624Q268 625 242 625Q201 625 165 599T128 534Q128 511 141 492T167 463T217 431Q224 426 228 424L286 386ZM250 21Q308 21 350 55T392 137Q392 154 387 169T375 194T353 216T330 234T301 253T274 270Q260 279 244 289T218 306L210 311Q204 311 181 294T133 239T107 157Q107 98 150 60T250 21Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-3C1\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2248\" x=\"795\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1851\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2630,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-30\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-38\" x=\"779\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-35\" x=\"1279\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"4410\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> there is a <em>strong negative</em> linear correlation in the data.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The <em>negative</em> linear correlation means that the data points should be scattered along a line with a <em>negative</em> slope. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Since the correlation is <em>strong</em>, most of the points should lie <em>close</em> to the trend line.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, this situation could correspond to the following scatter plot:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-5969291543b1cfbbf82e102483b5054c\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/5969291543b1cfbbf82e102483b5054c\"></div>\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
